sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Candidate
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant G as LangGraph
  participant L as LLM Provider
  C->>UI: Submit finalized answer
  UI->>API: POST answer + Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: Verify owner/state/question
  API->>DB: Claim turn lease + persist answer
  DB-->>API: Durable answer receipt
  API->>G: Resume graph with server thread ID
  G->>DB: Load finalized answer/context
  G->>L: Structured evaluation request
  L-->>G: Typed evaluation
  G->>DB: Commit evaluation + next state/question
  DB-->>API: Committed turn result
  API-->>UI: Authoritative session state
  UI-->>C: Show next question/report
